  "prefLabel": "Sphc 103.04 Attendance at Meetings By Members of the Public",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Sphc 103.04 Attendance at Meetings By Members of the Public. Pursuant to RSA 91-A:2, II, members of the public may attend and record board meetings, except for those parts of the meetings which are nonpublic sessions as defined in RSA 91-A:3.\n\nSource. #14193, eff 2-12-25",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/sphc100.html"
